    },
    {
      "Paragraph": [
        {
          "Text": "Understanding how a Tauri + Leptos application is structured is key to building scalable software. The app is split into two primary environments: the "
        },
        {
          "Bold": [
            {
              "Text": "Core Process"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "Text": " and the "
        },
        {
          "Bold": [
            {
              "Text": "WebView Process"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "Text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Heading": {
        "level": "H2",
        "children": [
          {
            "Text": "The Core Process (Rust)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "Paragraph": [
        {
          "Text": "The Core process is a native Rust application. It has full access to the operating system and is responsible for:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "UnorderedList": [
        {
          "checked": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "Paragraph": [
                {
                  "Text": "Window management and lifecycle."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Paragraph": [
                {
                  "Text": "Accessing the filesystem, network, and system APIs."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Paragraph": [
                {
                  "Text": "Managing global application state."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Paragraph": [
                {
                  "Text": "Handling security and permissions."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Heading": {
                "level": "H2",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "Text": "The WebView Process (Leptos/WASM)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "Paragraph": [
                {
                  "Text": "Rendering the HTML/CSS."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Paragraph": [
                {
                  "Text": "Handling user interactions."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Paragraph": [
                {
                  "Text": "Managing local UI state."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Heading": {
                "level": "H2",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "Text": "The Bridge (IPC)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
